From d42355af72913d774d77adb04952a6dc88c64f9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: song <songyiqiang1994@163.com>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 16:45:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] commit 2: Add async queue and background audit log
 thread

- Create audit.h and audit.c with ring buffer queue implementation
  using mutex and condition variable for thread safety
- Implement non-blocking push (queue full -> discard + increment abort count)
- Implement blocking pop with stop signal support
- Start consumer thread in InitServerLast(), stop in prepareForShutdown()
- Consumer thread just frees entries for now (file writing in next commit)
- Add audit.o to REDIS_SERVER_OBJ in Makefile
